# --- Teardown photographs: kept locally, never committed ---------------------
# Photographs of a competitor's internals are the largest publication exposure in
# this project, and once committed they persist in history. The engineering value
# lives in findings.md, not in the images. See PUBLISHING.md.
brainstorming/teardown/**/*.jpg
